    "title": "KashKick: Get paid to have fun",
    "description": "KashKick has paid out millions of dollars in real cash to our members, and the opportunities are getting better every week! The KashKick app is easy to use, provides incredible earning potential at your fingertips, and works around your schedule! \r\n\r\nGuess what\u2026 it gets better! There's no cost to sign up, and you can withdraw your available earnings even if you only have $10 (minimum). \r\n\r\nSo, how does it work?\r\n\r\nPlay Games and Earn Kash\r\nTake your pick from hundreds of games to earn extra cash. KashKick provides users with a marketplace of opportunities to earn rewards across many genres of games. Come and see for yourself!\r\n\r\nSign Up for Special Offers\r\nTurn your everyday purchases into reward opportunities with our partners. \r\n\r\nGet Paid for Your Opinion \r\nWe want to hear from you! The more surveys you complete, the more cash you can earn.",
